OL,3,ABBC Wales cuts risk 'irreversible
OL,4,Adeterioration', warns first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister has warned of an
OL,7,F"irreversible deterioration" in the way
OL,8,Fthe BBC covers Wales, if the
OL,9,Fcorporation proceeds with cuts as
OL,10,Fplanned.
OL,12,FThe warning comes in a letter to BBC
OL,13,Fdirector-general Matt Brittin, which
OL,14,Fhas been seen by BBC Wales.
OL,16,FThe letter also claims that the changes
OL,17,Fcould lead to the BBC being in breach
OL,18,Fof its public service obligations under
OL,19,Fits Royal Charter.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
