OL,3,ABBC Wales cuts risk 'irreversible
OL,4,Adeterioration', warns first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn reply, Brittin told First Minister
OL,7,FRhun ap Iorwerth that the BBC takes its
OL,8,Fobligations to Wales "extremely
OL,9,Fseriously".
